750 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In 2022\054 I led the product design team for the Government of Canada\047s new digital passport application service\054 joining as both design lead and AI specialist\056\n\nWith passport renewals surging\054 wait times at service centres continued to grow\054 leading the Government of Canada to invest in a fully digital passport renewal application to streamline the process\056 This solution allows citizens to renew their passports from home\054 improving accessibility and convenience\056 A key feature of the system is a real\055time computer\055vision tool that automatically validates passport photos during submission\054 reducing errors and accelerating processing times\056 By digitizing the renewal process and implementing AI\055driven technology\054 the government aimed to enhance the user experience and optimize operational efficiency\054 significantly reducing manual workloads and service bottlenecks\056\n\nThis case study will focus on the initial problem we set off to solve by digitizing the passport application experience\054 and how we determined the best way to incorporate an AI\055powered photo verification feature\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 751 0 R
     /Pg 734 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

751 0 obj
  << /K [ 750 0 R ]
     /P 796 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 734 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

