754 0 obj
  << /ActualText (To help resolve this issue for citizens\054 the Government of Canada reached out to IBM to build a full end\055to\055end web application that would allow people to quickly and easily renew their passports online\056 To do this successfully\054 the application needed to\072\n\nProvide a simplified responsive experience that would enable any Canadian to renew their passport online via desktop or mobile\056\nAccommodate both English and French translations of the content within the layout\056\nEnable citizens to upload a passport photo and have it evaluated in real time by AI\056\nAllow citizens to pay using their credit card online\056\nSupport renewing passports for dependents\056\nAdhere to the highest standard of accessibility criteria\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 755 0 R
     /Pg 734 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

