758 0 obj
  << /ActualText (As we translated business requirements into user stories with well\055defined acceptance criteria\054 I led a landscape analysis in collaboration with the product managers\054 business analysts\054 and designers\056 This involved researching online passport renewal services from other governments for benchmarking\056 During this process\054 we identified the New Zealand Government\047s digital renewal tool as an ideal comparison\054 as it also uses computer vision technology to evaluate passport photos in real time\056 New Zealand\047s implementation demonstrated an ethical approach to communicating the use of artificial intelligence to users during the photo evaluation process\054 along with the ability to opt out if they were uncomfortable with its usage\054 which we used as a foundation when building out our own\056\n\nThis analysis allowed us to uncover gaps in our own acceptance criteria\054 task flows\054 and content design\054 leading to critical improvements before moving into development\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 759 0 R
     /Pg 734 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

