770 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Government of Canada has strict branding criteria that all new websites and applications must adhere to\054 though the look and feel can vary by department\056 For this project\054 one key requirement was to develop a comprehensive design system and style guide tailored specifically for Immigration\054 Refugees and Citizenship Canada \050IRCC\051 to ensure consistency across all future applications\056\n\nWe began by conducting thorough design research on the existing branding standards to guide our decision\055making as we designed each component\056 The style guide clearly outlined the layout\054 structure\054 sizing\054 and variations for all components used in the passport renewal application\056)
     /K [ 18 ]
     /P 771 0 R
     /Pg 734 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

