776 0 obj
  << /ActualText (With one of the business objectives being to streamline the passport renewal process\054 it was important to design an experience that was quick and efficient for citizens to complete when renewing their passport\056 However\054 speed wasn\047t the only criterion for providing citizens with a good experience\056 We really needed to think about all Canadians and how their different scenarios and situations may mean we design the experience a bit differently to accommodate everyone\056\n\nThis meant considering Canadians of different age groups\054 language skills\054 computer skills\054 and accessibility needs to ensure that any Canadian\054 no matter who they are\054 can renew their passport online easily\056 This involved working with the accessibility team to make sure we met the established accessibility requirements\054 and working with content designers to make sure the language being used could be understood by all citizens\054 no matter their proficiency in English\056\n\nWe further addressed these issues by developing an end\055to\055end design process that included an accessibility review\054 in addition to a content style guide to ensure we were using clear and simplified terms consistently throughout the platform\056)
     /K [ 21 ]
     /P 777 0 R
     /Pg 734 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

