782 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The photo evaluation feature also required an internal\055facing application for IRCC employees\054 which demanded close coordination with the machine learning engineers and data scientists to ensure that the AI model used for evaluating passport photos was feasible within the given time frame\056 Since the model needed extensive training to accurately assess whether photos met passport requirements\054 eliminating potential technical vulnerabilities was critical to prevent exploitation by bad actors\056)
     /K [ 24 ]
     /P 783 0 R
     /Pg 734 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

