786 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Alongside the technical team\054 I also collaborated closely with the IRCC stakeholder team to create a process where humans would verify the AI\047s photo assessments until the model reached full confidence\056 This involved designing a user interface for employees to review the AI\047s analysis\054 as well as a page to adjust the model\047s sensitivity for specific photo evaluation criteria\056 Developing these screens\054 alongside the computer vision functionality\054 was both challenging and rewarding\054 knowing that\054 if done right\054 it would greatly accelerate the passport renewal process for citizens across the country\056)
     /K [ 26 ]
     /P 787 0 R
     /Pg 734 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

