792 0 obj
  << /ActualText (For Canadians\054 this new online passport web application provides a brand new experience that makes renewing a passport faster and easier than ever before while reducing wait times at physical locations\054 achieving the Government of Canada\047s business and experience objectives\056\n\nIn addition to the successful launch of the product\054 I was able to deliver a fully developed design system and style guide for government employees to use after my departure from the project following launch\056\n\nOur ethical approach to implementing an AI\055driven photo evaluation feature lets users decide whether they would like to use it to speed up the processing of their passports\056 They can feel comfortable knowing exactly how their data will be used and stored\054 while retaining the ability to opt out if they do not wish to use the feature\056)
     /K [ 29 ]
     /P 793 0 R
     /Pg 734 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

